  "__class__": "Meeting",
  "transcript": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "start": "00:02:18.080",
      "end": "00:02:21.090",
      "text": "Audio test from council chambers."
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "start": "00:02:21.090",
      "end": "00:02:22.950",
      "text": "I can hear you loud and clear."
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "start": "00:02:22.950",
      "end": "00:02:38.560",
      "text": "Thank you."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "start": "00:02:38.560",
      "end": "00:02:42.320",
      "text": "You want me to talk and test it?"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "start": "00:02:42.320",
      "end": "00:10:01.170",
      "text": "Thank you."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "start": "00:10:01.170",
      "end": "00:10:02.070",
      "text": "For colleagues on the committee,"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "start": "00:10:02.070",
      "end": "00:10:03.230",
      "text": "I'll just have you turn on your cameras"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "start": "00:10:03.230",
      "end": "00:10:08.310",
      "text": "so the clerk can confirm quorum."
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "start": "00:10:08.310",
      "end": "00:10:11.140",
      "text": "You do have quorum."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "start": "00:10:11.140",
      "end": "00:10:12.730",
      "text": "Perfect. Well, then I'll call the fourth meeting"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "start": "00:10:12.730",
      "end": "00:10:14.980",
      "text": "of the audit committee to order."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "start": "00:10:14.980",
      "end": "00:10:17.790",
      "text": "I'm gonna do a land acknowledgement"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "start": "00:10:17.790",
      "end": "00:10:20.260",
      "text": "and then we'll move right into the agenda."
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "start": "00:10:20.260",
      "end": "00:10:22.350",
      "text": "The city of London is situated on the traditional lands"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "start": "00:10:22.350",
      "end": "00:10:25.260",
      "text": "of the Anishinaabe, Haudenosaunee, Lenny Paywalk,"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "start": "00:10:25.260",
      "end": "00:10:27.170",
      "text": "and Adawandran."
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "start": "00:10:27.170",
      "end": "00:10:29.840",
      "text": "We honor and respect the history, language and culture,"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "start": "00:10:29.840",
      "end": "00:10:31.550",
      "text": "the diverse indigenous people"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "start": "00:10:31.550",
      "end": "00:10:33.130",
      "text": "called this territory home."
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "start": "00:10:33.130",
      "end": "00:10:34.370",
      "text": "The city of London is currently home"
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "start": "00:10:34.370",
      "end": "00:10:38.050",
      "text": "to many First Nations, M\u00e9tis and Inuit people today."
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "start": "00:10:38.050",
      "end": "00:10:40.470",
      "text": "As representatives of the people of the city of London,"
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "start": "00:10:40.470",
      "end": "00:10:42.030",
      "text": "we are grateful to have the opportunity"
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "start": "00:10:42.030",
      "end": "00:10:46.110",
      "text": "to work and live in this territory."
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "start": "00:10:46.110",
      "end": "00:10:47.740",
      "text": "The city of London is also committed"
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "start": "00:10:47.740",
      "end": "00:10:50.520",
      "text": "to making every effort to provide alternate formats"
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "start": "00:10:50.520",
      "end": "00:10:52.510",
      "text": "and communication supports for all of our meetings"
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "start": "00:10:52.510",
      "end": "00:10:53.580",
      "text": "upon request."
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "start": "00:10:53.580",
      "end": "00:10:55.410",
      "text": "To make a request specific to this meeting,"
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "start": "00:10:55.410",
      "end": "00:10:57.990",
      "text": "you can contact accessibility@lenny.ca"
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "start": "00:10:57.990",
      "end": "00:11:03.140",
      "text": "or 519-661-2489, extension 2425."
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "start": "00:11:03.140",
      "end": "00:11:07.870",
      "text": "I will start with disclosures of pecuniary interest."
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "start": "00:11:07.870",
      "end": "00:11:11.650",
      "text": "Are there any?"
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "start": "00:11:11.650",
      "end": "00:11:12.480",
      "text": "I see none."
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "start": "00:11:12.480",
      "end": "00:11:13.460",
      "text": "We have no consent items."
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "start": "00:11:13.460",
      "end": "00:11:15.270",
      "text": "We have no scheduled items."
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "start": "00:11:15.270",
      "end": "00:11:16.970",
      "text": "We have one item for direction,"
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "start": "00:11:16.970",
      "end": "00:11:20.400",
      "text": "which is the follow up on some items"
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "start": "00:11:20.400",
      "end": "00:11:24.130",
      "text": "from the internal audit dashboard."
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "start": "00:11:24.130",
      "end": "00:11:28.990",
      "text": "We have members from MNP, MNP available here,"
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "start": "00:11:28.990",
      "end": "00:11:30.170",
      "text": "if colleagues have any questions."
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "start": "00:11:30.170",
      "end": "00:11:32.420",
      "text": "Maybe I'll go straight to colleagues for questions"
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "start": "00:11:32.420",
      "end": "00:11:34.000",
      "text": "and if there are none, this will be a motion to receive."
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "start": "00:11:34.000",
      "end": "00:11:35.620",
      "text": "But let's go see if there's any questions first"
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "start": "00:11:35.620",
      "end": "00:11:42.940",
      "text": "that colleagues have questions."
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "start": "00:11:42.940",
      "end": "00:11:47.150",
      "text": "Councilor Van Wollst."
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "start": "00:11:47.150",
      "end": "00:11:48.010",
      "text": "Thank you, Mr. Chair."
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "start": "00:11:48.010",
      "end": "00:11:51.940",
      "text": "And to you, I see there's the,"
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "start": "00:11:51.940",
      "end": "00:11:53.960",
      "text": "we've got just off the top,"
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "start": "00:11:53.960",
      "end": "00:12:00.460",
      "text": "key performance indicators for the ICO system."
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "start": "00:12:00.460",
      "end": "00:12:12.230",
      "text": "And now when will that be in place?"
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "start": "00:12:12.230",
      "end": "00:12:16.850",
      "text": "Sure, if that's a question for our staff or Mr. Jazzwell."
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "start": "00:12:16.850",
      "end": "00:12:24.090",
      "text": "Like perhaps our staff, but maybe our auditors know the answer."
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "start": "00:12:24.090",
      "end": "00:12:29.390",
      "text": "Sure, good afternoon, everybody."
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "start": "00:12:29.390",
      "end": "00:12:31.780",
      "text": "It's Veronica Beale here from MNP."
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "start": "00:12:31.780",
      "end": "00:12:35.380",
      "text": "So we did do the follow up on these items"
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "start": "00:12:35.380",
      "end": "00:12:37.630",
      "text": "and it's this specific one"
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "start": "00:12:37.630",
      "end": "00:12:38.980",
      "text": "for the key performance indicators"
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "start": "00:12:38.980",
      "end": "00:12:42.150",
      "text": "for the fire process assessment audit."
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "start": "00:12:42.150",
      "end": "00:12:44.950",
      "text": "The due date is December, 2022."
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "start": "00:12:44.950",
      "end": "00:12:46.900",
      "text": "Management has told us that they are on track"
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "start": "00:12:46.900",
      "end": "00:12:53.020",
      "text": "to complete that by that due date."
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "start": "00:12:53.020",
      "end": "00:12:54.540",
      "text": "Thank you."
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "start": "00:12:54.540",
      "end": "00:12:56.350",
      "text": "Councilor Turner is joining us, Councilor Turner,"
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "start": "00:12:56.350",
      "end": "00:12:58.880",
      "text": "we're on questions on the report"
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "start": "00:12:58.880",
      "end": "00:13:00.260",
      "text": "and just going around with colleagues"
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "start": "00:13:00.260",
      "end": "00:13:01.840",
      "text": "to see if they have any."
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "start": "00:13:01.840",
      "end": "00:13:05.100",
      "text": "Any further questions on this?"
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "start": "00:13:05.100",
      "end": "00:13:06.580",
      "text": "Okay, I look for a mover."
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "start": "00:13:06.580",
      "end": "00:13:10.420",
      "text": "This is an information report for receipt."
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "start": "00:13:10.420",
      "end": "00:13:13.510",
      "text": "Moved by Councilor Halmer, seconded by Councilor Turner."
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "start": "00:13:13.510",
      "end": "00:13:16.880",
      "text": "Any discussion on receipt of this?"
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "start": "00:13:16.880",
      "end": "00:13:18.110",
      "text": "Okay, then we'll do this vote by hand."
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "start": "00:13:18.110",
      "end": "00:13:21.710",
      "text": "All those in favor of receipt?"
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "start": "00:13:21.710",
      "end": "00:13:24.640",
      "text": "For motion carries."
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "start": "00:13:24.640",
      "end": "00:13:26.680",
      "text": "And that is the only item we had for direction."
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "start": "00:13:26.680",
      "end": "00:13:27.970",
      "text": "Are there any other deferred matters"
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "start": "00:13:27.970",
      "end": "00:13:30.860",
      "text": "or additional business colleagues?"
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "start": "00:13:30.860",
      "end": "00:13:34.220",
      "text": "Seeing none, I'd look for a motion to adjourn."
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "start": "00:13:34.220",
      "end": "00:13:37.160",
      "text": "Councilor Turner, seconded by Councilor Vanholz,"
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "start": "00:13:37.160",
      "end": "00:13:37.970",
      "text": "if we need one."
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "start": "00:13:37.970",
      "end": "00:13:40.570",
      "text": "All those in favor of adjournment today?"
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "start": "00:13:40.570",
      "end": "00:13:41.370",
      "text": "Motion carries."
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "start": "00:13:41.370",
      "end": "00:13:44.270",
      "text": "Okay, thank you for your time today, everyone."
    }
  ],
